# Card tracking

1. `tracking.cards.required` is always true — MD in `docs/tracking/cards/` is canonical.
2. **No feature-delivery** without an active card (`in_progress`) covering the REQ(s).
3. Every REQ must belong to ≥1 card (enforced at `mvp_planning.status: complete`).
4. Do not open card `in_progress` until `mvp_planning.status: complete`.
5. Branch/PR preferentially per **CARD**, not isolated REQ.
6. Close card only when **all** linked REQ specs meet DoD.

Workflow: [docs/operations/issue-cards.md](../../docs/operations/issue-cards.md)  
Skill: `card-tracking`
